  "independent_scope": "Whole native selected-source content on both mattes, all9 selected poses plus adopted neutral at inherited maximum body reference 430.000000px across5both-matte pages, and all7 decoded discrete recipe rows actually viewed. Historical unselected sheet cells are not accepted by viewing their whole source. Physical UI zoom/density and real-time/interpolated/MP4 output not measured.",
  "observations": "Selected eight original-sheet poses plus fresh left-presentation singleton independently inspected at native and declared max430 on both mattes. Warm light-brown large head/short upright body, pink nose/inner ears, pale chest tuft, white eye surrounds with brown pupils, two membranous wings acting as arms and two small feet preserve canonical identity. Quiet blink closes eyelids with closely matching ear/head/jaw/torso and grounded feet; no material size jump or blur. Fresh present_left correctly extends viewer-left existing wing with leftward pupils, while retained present_right extends viewer-right and looks right. Finger spars remain attached inside the single membrane per wing, no new human hand, duplicated arm or torn joint. Think folds near wing to chin, aha lifts it, cheer lifts both, species phases open both wings wide then fold inward with both feet retained. Whole native and max composites show legible eyes/nose/tuft/spars/toes, clean outside mattes and no cut wing tips, dirty paint, duplicated features or effect mark. All7 decoded recipe rows viewed with clear state order/returns; no realtime claim.",
